            "Counselling is deliberately measured. You will hear what nerve regeneration can and cannot do, the gradual timeline involved, and what useful recovery looks like for your specific nerve and level. This candour is designed to build trust for the long rehabilitation ahead, because nerve recovery is a partnership measured in months.",
